{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_title", "source_sha256": "33dc7cf4814d2d569ea7b49ce7dc2e821201f6ce50f07661087b70c66ebbaf5d", "ja": "みんなが教えてくれたこと", "zh": "大家教会我的事", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f62c7449a606c33838561be5ec6de750ae20a8bc7a664d1c759b52eef3c2c76d", "ja": "舞台のダブル主演が決まった桃子。共演相手\nに挨拶を無視され皆から心配されるが、本人\nはあまり気にしていない。自分から人に話し\nかけ色々教えたりするうちに、桃子はそれが\n『仲間達が教えてくれた事』だと気がつく。", "zh": "桃子确定要担任舞台剧的双主演。虽然打招呼时被共演者无视而让大家很担心，但她本人并不怎么介意。而在主动找人搭话、教对方各种事情的过程中，桃子意识到了这正是“同伴们教会自己的事”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7a0f4dfd556388997862513bdee1bbaa8e1b650b02b0c964ac76ceffa8bdfebb", "ja": "（記者会見の後、劇場に戻ってきた。みんなは……\nちょうど、定期公演のレッスンが始まる時間だな）", "zh": "（记者会结束后，回到了剧场。大家……正好是定期公演开始上课的时间呢）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "ac132f20caa4e7f3b679cbf49e887dbbb33d06bc972ab1f05250df72c135677c", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\n桃子も、レッスンに参加してもいい？", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n桃子也可以参加训练吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "52ceda3e957abce9c30d614e8289e140b43e1e4ee66573775cc401d6c4640958", "ja": "桃子ちゃん、お疲れさま！\nそれはもちろん、大歓迎だけど……大丈夫？", "zh": "桃子，辛苦了！\n那当然，欢迎之至，不过……没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "c1f4e38787b9cfb41f92b838adfe8b12534a0c29decdf3d5b7b471d4dc925483", "ja": "記者会見だったんでしょ、どうだった？\n今日くらい、休みにしてもいいのよ？", "zh": "刚才是记者发布会吧，怎么样？\n今天好歹休息一下也没关系的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "59f6580aa7365e890b71ca0445e75e5b11e684c420ced9484070eba140bbbb86", "ja": "今日は記者会見と、取材用の本読みだけだから。\nそんなに大変じゃなかったよ。", "zh": "今天只有记者会和为采访做的读稿而已。\n没那么辛苦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "cbfc8c09a158f382635f25fb9c716f6508b574a178d17e5a0ecfc5b328603a66", "ja": "そっかぁ。\nなら、困ったこととかもなかった？", "zh": "这样啊。\n那有没有遇到什么麻烦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "7a64ff53b1e465a09947d68cf548829e2ad6647e087ad24f72dcf2764a5963e6", "ja": "困ったこと……あ。\nなんか、ダブル主演の子に、無視されちゃったかも？", "zh": "困扰的事……啊。\n好像，被双主演的那个孩子无视了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "f3101f8652a47ca91451359e637ccea0bb9f517b3fc0d01fdf499e1fb84f1f40", "ja": "ええっ！？　ど、どうして……？", "zh": "咦咦！？为、为什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "f2b0a62eb9f8ae2f5c59efe2accc943afa2b23e45b9aa56ff176bc2d85bdfcdc", "ja": "さあ……？　いちおう、挨拶はしたんだけどね。\n桃子、あの子とは初対面だと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "这个嘛……？我姑且还是打过招呼了。\n不过，桃子应该是第一次见那孩子吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "4ece7edac08cb6caabb65a4954c966b0a6d36c994d6f2dcc1399bf41ec36eff6", "ja": "も、桃子の挨拶を無視するなんて……！\nアタシ、ちょっと文句言ってくる！", "zh": "居然无视桃子的问候……！\n我去跟她理论理论！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "0e25d84afd75351deca69afad81d61385040c3fa2b41cb02f3309aaa873ecac7", "ja": "のり子ちゃんが行くなら、私も！\n一緒に行って、「メッ！」てしてくる！", "zh": "既然法子要去，那我也去！\n我们一起去，好好“训”他们一顿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "3fb85c566e2a04284c1aba3413dd6bf6772b740c553cb0fe1ba70f21e6e1f51e", "ja": "ちょっと、のり子さんも麗花さんも落ち着いて！\nもう、小さい子じゃないんだから。", "zh": "喂，纪子、丽花，你们也冷静点！都已经不是小孩子了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "f375a0cf196d247293acb2f87409efacbbfcd0e56019a4a2eab292db54917566", "ja": "別に、何かされたわけじゃないんだし。\nいきなりそんなことしたら、話がこじれるでしょ。", "zh": "又没对我做什么。\n突然那样做的话，事情会变得复杂的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "784fc103447adfb54d53bbc19e42da00243a68c92b66dddb8c41ea4233f0fb41", "ja": "それは、そうかもしれないけど……。もう！\n{$P$}くんたら、何してたのよ～！", "zh": "话是这么说没错……真是的！\n{$P$}，你到底在干什么呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8688d3d1f23d328b9f0d2aa96f1c20bdf4e2c1392ed8a6315ed79313bdf8d907", "ja": "いや、桃子が口を出すなって言うから。", "zh": "不是，是因为桃子叫我别多嘴啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "c41fbf8179b80fb72c20ed23e5df5bf6a830cf045ea4ae53001316e045a01eaa", "ja": "そう！　お兄ちゃんも。桃子が何か言うまで、\n手も口も出しちゃダメだからね。", "zh": "没错！哥哥也是。在桃子开口之前，手上和嘴上都不许插手哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1016_p", "source_sha256": "92137c3ab28a5a76b17300baf5e4ba127e1fbe646e29534c6de02e810d87e0f2", "ja": "ああ、わかってる。\nみんなも、少し落ち着こう。", "zh": "啊，我知道了。\n大家也先冷静一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1017_p", "source_sha256": "19de58d2838aeb7b815c7fbba68e17f0005678a030be95462a3f2d7fef43133e", "ja": "本当にダメなことがあったら、桃子はちゃんと\n俺やみんなを頼ってくれるはずだ。", "zh": "如果真的遇到解决不了的事情，桃子应该会好好依靠我和大家的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "ebbe305c2d77bc526eded81ab16ae7b67b2a71c98e5408dc3d5deb73cf136d4f", "ja": "そういうこと！\nお兄ちゃんも、すこしはわかってきたみたいだね♪", "zh": "就是这样！\n哥哥好像也渐渐明白了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "181f81797bc5f9249f308b4b0433266ca91a4d798c99de0e87f8f7ec57a9763e", "ja": "うぅ……。なんか納得できないけど、\n桃子がそう言うなら……。", "zh": "呜……总觉得有点无法接受，可是既然桃子都这么说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "f7a0941112b0046ca2d051025ce768efc608503efc9d0bf2a21cab5727608ae2", "ja": "はいはい。そろそろ着替えて、レッスン始めよう？\nおしゃべりしてたら、時間が終わっちゃうよ。", "zh": "好啦好啦。差不多该换衣服，开始训练了吧？\n再聊下去，时间就要用完啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "8b57ce50126cf43f3c22502043d4f27c246e72a6cfea30b082b394db2bc20233", "ja": "は～い！\nそれじゃあみんなで、着替えにゴーゴー♪", "zh": "好～的！\n那大家一起去换衣服吧，冲冲冲♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1023_p", "source_sha256": "56510dcf0e5debfc06c0cb8ab57d7c82d6cf594795e0bf25f4b5e30c72460724", "ja": "桃子、今日はお疲れ様。\nまだ帰らないのか？", "zh": "桃子，今天辛苦了。\n还不回去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "c7f0143868425b42749f1a7e43ae5a40c3e283a2520dc3d484ffc5644cf92847", "ja": "あ、お兄ちゃん……。\nちょっと、考えごとしてただけだよ。", "zh": "啊，哥哥……  \n我只是在想些事情而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1025_p", "source_sha256": "6e1aab9b32779fe253e1341a9e6ab3d81b5d41a7d2cf4529ee6785dcc3a63fae", "ja": "考えごと？", "zh": "在想事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "ee113007146486738712e8da59bb8ccb1d75cfa99c819d1101d7a61131bdc9eb", "ja": "うん。あの子……凛々加さんは、\nどうして桃子を無視したのかな？って。", "zh": "嗯。我在想，那个女孩子……凛凛加小姐，\n为什么要无视桃子呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "5d7ee5e133608a3afada7130106b9650d4dc339086a6af23da43834f3d6bf3b6", "ja": "これから、いっしょに仕事しなきゃなのに。イヤな\n態度をとったら、やりづらくなるのは自分でしょ？", "zh": "明明接下来还得一起工作。要是摆出讨厌的态度，最后觉得难办的不也是自己吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1028_p", "source_sha256": "6977586b883072fdb06c63999b7f397b445f8711f58d6fa7aa63507123d53519", "ja": "そうだな……。もしかしたら凛々加さんは、\n桃子を、脅威に感じたのかもしれないな。", "zh": "是啊……说不定，凛凛加小姐是觉得桃子对她构成了威胁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "839be0f6f0847bf5a65c7754c56658e0dd7cf30355535dd213341d753da65f77", "ja": "脅威？\n……それって、桃子がこわいってこと？", "zh": "威胁？\n……意思是说，桃子很可怕吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1030_p", "source_sha256": "368b57d7e1612904ad734bae69ec50411d0a0f0750bcb3c663e6400a99252837", "ja": "凛々加さんの事務所は、うちより大手だ。\n年齢も、桃子のひとつ上だったかな。", "zh": "凛々加的事务所比我们规模更大。\n她的年龄好像也比桃子大一岁来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1031_p", "source_sha256": "3be81de8e9dee04b238159e725cd12c2b44606dafe5d76cf64e163b6c9d6f9b7", "ja": "でも演技に関して言えば彼女は新人で、桃子は\nベテランだ。本読みでも当然、差を感じたと思う。", "zh": "不过，就演技而言，她还是新人，而桃子可是老手。我想，光是在读剧本时，她当然也感受到了差距。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1033_p", "source_sha256": "03571fecd33468132837a993c031b94558e8bf8dcf649cc402637a40074edf95", "ja": "ダブル主演である以上、これから彼女は、\n常に桃子と比べられる事になる。", "zh": "既然是双主演，今后她就会一直被拿来和桃子比较。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1034_p", "source_sha256": "9ae67a43251235c29760cf17499144cc22775a4ee993d69008a8b261772d9244", "ja": "だから、警戒してたんじゃないかな。ただ桃子の\n言うとおり、やりづらくなるのは自分だけど。", "zh": "所以，她才会有所戒备吧。不过，正如桃子所说，变得难做的只有自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "866acbe9c4dcb5e71c405e3df4c57147ad8f436357e8e2ce8810ab68e83d7610", "ja": "……。お兄ちゃん。\n桃子、どうしたらいいと思う？", "zh": "……。大哥哥。\n你觉得桃子该怎么办才好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1036_p", "source_sha256": "055008d8f7888af3460960d3fa45bcfc1d37179012ec308c8d76620a7c168082", "ja": "相手の気持ち次第だからな。桃子は、\nいつもどおりの桃子のままでいいと思うよ。", "zh": "这得看对方的心情吧。桃子，我觉得你只要做平时的桃子就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1037_p", "source_sha256": "f39abb08f6047cf67722c294fa65ccb11b8c75e1634efa30e988ae5a5eb22d83", "ja": "それでも何か困る事があったら、言ってくれ。\n俺から、演出家さんに掛け合ってみるから。", "zh": "不过，要是还是遇到什么为难的事，就告诉我。我会去跟导演沟通的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1038_049mom", "source_sha256": "84f91a75eaa90ad6e819fb3b4026b4b2d29aad24c6afd25d60d02b7e5255107d", "ja": "わかった。\n……ありがとね、お兄ちゃん。", "zh": "知道了。\n……谢谢你，哥哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1039_p", "source_sha256": "f4959a2e7547aad9dd4729af2e7724dae017ecfc202cc6384c916e588adc7a09", "ja": "桃子のプロデューサーなんだから、当然だよ。\n……主演舞台、絶対成功させような！", "zh": "既然我是桃子的制作人，这是当然的。\n……主演舞台，我们一定要让它成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1040_049mom", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1041_null", "source_sha256": "16313908fa20fc70afdd55eccdda18a60f01c5446e713e4fa58101d148c6b948", "ja": "数日後、舞台の稽古中……", "zh": "几天后，舞台排练中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1042_049mom", "source_sha256": "d08712342446e3158fde56faeb0e53dbf52232c23213125befff622b1d626601", "ja": "あっ……凛々加さん、お疲れさま。\n今日、いっしょなんだね。", "zh": "啊……凛凛加小姐，辛苦了。\n今天也一起排练呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1044_049mom", "source_sha256": "65879b9aec211841919e9fb6cdd9b888e6471dca74063941f6cda62d1508e2c0", "ja": "（もう、また無視？　カンジ悪いなぁ）", "zh": "（真是的，又无视我？态度真差。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1045_049mom", "source_sha256": "42bac91ab57e97bb0428a700c8ad29f3d2e8e5609acbf268f5e84b976e5cb8fd", "ja": "（ま、このくらいで、いちいちめげてられないけど。\n他の人が来るまで、柔軟でもして待ってようっと）", "zh": "（不过，不能因为这点小事就消沉。趁其他人来之前，先做做拉伸等着吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1046_kyouhannsyaa", "source_sha256": "73d3fd83726ac42a89166112e65d7673b712cd600c300d8ed85da7b8c78ebaa7", "ja": "ねえ、これどういう意味か知ってる？\n板付きって何？　バミ指定……？", "zh": "喂，你知道这是什么意思吗？\n“板付”是什么？“指定站位”……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1047_049mom", "source_sha256": "c73c32f4713aa9f68378e4224107d9fa101f073d94f5d973db1f610fc45d88c0", "ja": "板付きは、幕が開いた時に、舞台に立ってるように\nってこと。バミは、床に貼ってある目印のテープだよ。", "zh": "板附是指开幕时就站在舞台上。所谓定位标记，就是贴在地板上的标记胶带。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1048_kyouhannsyaa", "source_sha256": "5aaff6b764723879327e570e6cc877d83315610dbe23237a3a0d755f2d432c35", "ja": "あ、ありがとう……！\nごめんね、専門用語全然わからなくて……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢……！\n对不起，我完全听不懂专业术语……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1049_049mom", "source_sha256": "c8410da50cb01785148356a3451004ad03196fd5f013b95b934b0efbdd614783", "ja": "舞台とかの言葉って、独特だよね。\n知ってることなら、桃子が教えてあげられるよ。", "zh": "舞台剧之类的术语很特别呢。要是桃子知道的话，可以教你哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1050_kyouhannsyaa", "source_sha256": "5f095f1d302ec08602a5da258531557d1bfe25c4503a3236ac98eeb29cc38a0d", "ja": "う、うん！\nありがとう……！", "zh": "嗯、嗯！\n谢谢你……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1052_sensei", "source_sha256": "dff546a99c67efe90eff0167dd37acbabf615c4d4fac7bc2205d822110daaff6", "ja": "ストップ！\nそこ、移動が遅いですよ。もっと素早く！", "zh": "停下！\n那里移动得太慢了。再快一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1053_kyouhannsyab", "source_sha256": "90ff2aa6af3ee766ad6b051c9ecb45e6f3589289c8635018d86040b46a626f5a", "ja": "す、すみません！\nもう一回お願いします！", "zh": "对、对不起！\n请再来一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1054_049mom", "source_sha256": "10b3022073fbd6129daad449a15d2386ad5679e8085a75907aa3a61b942e54ad", "ja": "先生！　その子、足首を痛めてます。\nテーピングを強めに巻いてもらってたので。", "zh": "老师！那孩子的脚踝受伤了。\n因为之前让人把贴布缠得比较紧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1055_kyouhannsyab", "source_sha256": "5f32adf12da3542d555fce8e6e15b7f7872389d9361a32398cf1061b9ecf3040", "ja": "あ、だ、大丈夫だよ！\n大したケガじゃないし……。", "zh": "啊，没、没事的！\n不是什么严重的伤……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1056_sensei", "source_sha256": "f10a920ec092b2974d8c5cba58f4be4134efdb1f1dbfd77fbeafd2d21566f25d", "ja": "そうなの？　ダメでしょ、ちゃんと言わなくちゃ。\n無理をするのが、いい稽古じゃないのよ。", "zh": "是这样吗？不行哦，得好好说出来才行。\n勉强自己可不是什么好的练习方式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1057_kyouhannsyab", "source_sha256": "209197354e9ae668c782a62dd6f4c7e59eeb0c5ddab41e9ddf3b2c0116eaa793", "ja": "は、はい……。", "zh": "是、是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1058_049mom", "source_sha256": "d8f374eece01cd612e83106bb494a479f62565eca4e278dfb9f4ff53560f8e23", "ja": "今のところ、台本読みだけしてみない？\nそれなら、座ったままできるでしょ。", "zh": "要不先只试着读读剧本？\n这样的话，坐着也能做吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1059_kyouhannsyab", "source_sha256": "c897a368baac099f382b985933fae28862dcc713c1b14f3ebf3143f5c5ce4273", "ja": "い、いいの？\n周防さん、ありがとう……！", "zh": "可、可以吗？\n周防同学，谢谢你……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1061_049mom", "source_sha256": "57cf4cd7b2ff2060f6a69d59856b8bb2ee7670b0b5d69ce7bc9c46d21c8fe849", "ja": "あ、凛々加さん。\n台本持って、こっちに来て。", "zh": "啊，凛々加小姐。拿着剧本，到这边来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1062_ririka", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1063_049mom", "source_sha256": "b62c34d2a0d3e145b242d3db917c254b4b94cc36e606e3f635340efda80c2b97", "ja": "ほら、早く。", "zh": "快点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1064_ririka", "source_sha256": "5311f71ce31be8196ab7ec7a23f989d2da82cb3ad087088bc184b645e2f63eb7", "ja": "……。\nなんで私まで……。", "zh": "……。\n为什么连我也……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1065_049mom", "source_sha256": "32c8b89dcbc6196ba86c81b2638fc2435cffa60dee42844cae2ab66573498e52", "ja": "？　だってここ、桃子と凛々加さんが\n初めて舞台に並んで立つ、大事なシーンでしょ。", "zh": "？因为这里是桃子和凛凛加小姐第一次并肩站在舞台上的重要场景啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1066_049mom", "source_sha256": "82e4c229861c0108144f13c82a579c1416bf502596d28166fa073149e10a8793", "ja": "いっしょに台本読んでおくと、流れが頭に入るよ。\nそのほうが楽だから。", "zh": "一起先把剧本读一遍，就能记住流程了。\n那样比较轻松。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1068_null", "source_sha256": "8e650032e46694d7b7a763d977b8998fdb263ef3656151e54088ab35be3cc7d1", "ja": "稽古開始から1週間後……", "zh": "开始排练1周后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1069_049mom", "source_sha256": "d2933e4d7e284b15ba856036a268da0d624be618f4d11b984e8464a8275a43c7", "ja": "迎えに来るっていったのに、お兄ちゃん遅いな……。\nしょうがない、台本でも読んで……あれ？", "zh": "明明说好要来接我的，哥哥怎么还没来啊……。没办法，先看看剧本吧……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1071_049mom", "source_sha256": "3acc6847d84caefabfff0f89e762f51f48c87659bc3761616256b3733d9db00f", "ja": "凛々加さん？\n今日は、稽古お休みだって聞いたけど……。", "zh": "凛々加？\n\n听说今天不用排练了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1072_ririka", "source_sha256": "dfcfcfc45c8015e384f494472e49719a786a586d93fc22677ea62dcd137fb674", "ja": "……ねえ。\nあなた、どうして私に話しかけるの？", "zh": "……我说。\n你为什么总来找我搭话呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1073_ririka", "source_sha256": "887dbc99a550812e5d33fc277a68a9d5789f5a9fa50f9d89f8d5fb6455038ca0", "ja": "私たち、ダブル主演でしょ。\n事務所も違うし、ライバルなんだよ。", "zh": "我们是双主演吧。\n事务所也不同，是竞争对手哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1074_049mom", "source_sha256": "7acd4775d48f28aaa1cf9e1f8fb114b62b54a9081eafc676ffc4871a1c89e60e", "ja": "え？　……あ、そっか。\nそうだよね……。", "zh": "诶？……啊，对哦。\n是这样呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1076_049mom", "source_sha256": "9a211c65401debcfb129add81162581f19bd333ca7a54f1d43e5f45e428262c1", "ja": "今までの桃子だったら、話しかけなかったかも。\nえっと……凛々加さん。", "zh": "如果是以前的桃子，可能不会主动搭话。\n那个……凛凛加小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1077_ririka", "source_sha256": "2f1db7c0f7163fa9d1121faa4ad2387d09f9de28bf3817a35069df60f556bb33", "ja": "……なに？", "zh": "……什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1078_049mom", "source_sha256": "7c4ad4ecd87f7b1baabc22ea3ab67fcd1af1038cdeba620f976b41e8c6b8c0df", "ja": "ライバルだと、いっしょに稽古したりとか……\nあんまり、仲良くしないほうがいいのかな？", "zh": "既然是竞争对手……是不是不太适合一起练习，或者关系太亲密呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1079_ririka", "source_sha256": "3fe60d440330024b62eae6a6fa26c659cdd07ac5c78a049527d94f0533f1d912", "ja": "……普通、そうでしょ。", "zh": "……一般来说，应该是这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1080_ririka", "source_sha256": "c244738c237870da39b750d4683ae07f50e957abb83ca84c3dfe56941f0e06f4", "ja": "私、自分のグループの子ともそんなに話さないし。\n事務所は同じだけど、みんなライバルだから……。", "zh": "我跟自己组合里的成员也没怎么说过话。\n虽然同属一家事务所，但大家都是竞争对手……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1081_049mom", "source_sha256": "0e14eea961831c23cb1fdd571e442cc3c0f10033f1c239c35f205103a4737e3d", "ja": "そうなんだ。……じゃあ765プロって、\nやっぱりすごく変わってるのかも。", "zh": "这样啊……那765制作人，说不定真的很奇怪呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1082_049mom", "source_sha256": "cb9f8baab16115ba99c01202fc477cee548a9a2611765f2c751e68baa9e547dc", "ja": "みんなライバルだし、勝負で手を抜いたりしないけど。\nでもそれ以外は、仲良くしてるから。", "zh": "大家虽然是竞争对手，比试时也绝不会放水。\n但除此以外，彼此都相处得很融洽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1083_ririka", "source_sha256": "ae2bd452d50983cf1d00272d49dc1a91e487fc152025c0d701b9a9897a9ef5e7", "ja": "……、いいな……。", "zh": "……真好啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1084_049mom", "source_sha256": "0a4d95016e9829ba0eeaff730a27aff60db53106ac02e0379674cc815f62252f", "ja": "いいでしょ。", "zh": "挺好的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1085_ririka", "source_sha256": "b0a69977980d93a9d86edc9ee5e937e85d06d6b25225de178bb60ec4e4df1a43", "ja": "……そっちばっかり、ズルい。\n私だって、そういうのがいいのに……。", "zh": "……只有那边那样，太狡猾了。\n明明我也想那样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1086_049mom", "source_sha256": "bda2a8af84c8d30858adf5f997f1e8287ae598f63649bdd5d06789e6d454e10c", "ja": "うーん、そうだよね。\nでも、仲間を交換なんてできないし……。", "zh": "嗯，说得也是。\n但是，伙伴可没法交换……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1088_049mom", "source_sha256": "dfd25f62fe1234a5c818541bd38ae655a10450efea40b5e233ab802e4b6049be", "ja": "みんなだったら、きっとひとりになんてさせないから。\nだから桃子も、凛々加さんに挨拶するし声も掛けるよ。", "zh": "要是大家在的话，肯定不会让她一个人的。  \n所以桃子也会跟凛凛加打招呼，也会主动和她说话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1089_ririka", "source_sha256": "958912d7a1df6bfb2adc7285e5748271496fbeec8308a2031e78bb508300f786", "ja": "なら……\nなら私に、お芝居のこと教えて。", "zh": "那么……  \n那么，教教我演戏吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1090_049mom", "source_sha256": "bfd2c3dfaf871657e9612ae8ddc19565ba81e545e4a0993674cea6595c77536d", "ja": "いいよ。あと『そっち』じゃなくて、周防桃子。\nよろしくね、凛々加さん。", "zh": "好啊。还有，别叫“你那边”，我叫周防桃子。\n请多关照啦，凛凛加小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1091_ririka", "source_sha256": "398e12af051fa18914d69e73d351550239762b16001ead13f363e44082680f7e", "ja": "うん。\n……よろしく、桃子さん。", "zh": "嗯。\n……请多关照，桃子前辈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1093_p", "source_sha256": "3c51a5d6e881aed9c62608b3c577f0734bdfc58275aaa7f94fd18f12e3a8803f", "ja": "（桃子を迎えにきたけど……\nもうすこし、時間を潰してきた方がよさそうだな）", "zh": "（我是来接桃子的，不过……\n看来还是再去消磨一会儿时间比较好。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1094_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1095_043nor", "source_sha256": "99c9311cf90166f395bf174666d06f9cc66c6fdd3f246c4be64511d45be1f069", "ja": "桃子はああ言ってたけど……今回の舞台って、\n765プロのメンバー誰もいないでしょ？", "zh": "桃子虽然那么说过……不过，这次的舞台上，765事务所的成员一个都没有，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1096_043nor", "source_sha256": "c4415545c1d79d16aee90bca476b90d83c7bee44cf8c2a3870054f205dc02340", "ja": "桃子はお芝居に真剣だから、何があっても投げ出さない\nだろうけど。頼れる人がそばにいないのは……ううっ。", "zh": "桃子对演戏很认真，所以不管发生什么，应该都不会半途而废吧。可是身边没有可以依靠的人……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1097_046rio", "source_sha256": "1b5213bcd5fe0d68f403676b12bf655c2a3e39f0bac150df51d51a17dba912cf", "ja": "そうなのよね～。桃子ちゃんは大人っぽいけど、\n大人じゃないもの……ああ、心配だわ……。", "zh": "就是这样呢～桃子看起来很成熟，可她毕竟还不是大人……啊啊，真让人担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1098_p", "source_sha256": "a273a340cbe038ad46e179c65df69ebf1e0d1e5d9bb39ec4eebb4a03782fafc8", "ja": "みんな、少し心配しすぎじゃないか？\n逆に、桃子はそういうのを気にすると思うけど……。", "zh": "大家是不是有点太担心了？\n反倒是桃子可能会在意这种事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1099_001har", "source_sha256": "e353843b5e5f862af0efceb350d43131f55952a8ca5e584b9e01dd904fa89fe0", "ja": "確かに……。自分のせいでレッスンが遅れてるかも、\nなんて聞いたら、桃子ちゃん……。", "zh": "说得也是……。要是让她听到说，可能是因为自己导致大家的练习进度落后了，桃子她……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1100_048rei", "source_sha256": "3b2e60175c7563ec83c6254e637b8f55423ac0b7e20ee9e46c247bae12980c6d", "ja": "高～い踏み台に乗って、みんなに、\nぷんぷん！！ってしちゃうかも？", "zh": "站到高高的踏台上，对大家气鼓鼓地说“哼哼！！”也说不定？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1101_p", "source_sha256": "0a4bc5cc5908311592e672ff4608c615fb536aafa922cbbbe426feeeab2e9559", "ja": "まぁ、みんなの心配もわかるよ。\nという訳だから、見学に行かないか？", "zh": "嗯，我也明白大家为什么会担心。既然这样，要不要一起去参观？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1102_046rio", "source_sha256": "52e4a84407e7b80200d326b8ff4af88a852b8a1df3c4b13dad44851620dd0271", "ja": "え？\n見学って……いいの？", "zh": "诶？\n去观摩……真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1103_p", "source_sha256": "0af1c4fd1ee08a51cc2396494b121ed167b33e7733e0791480d1aa40d0495d89", "ja": "本番前日に、ゲネプロ公演があるんだ。桃子が\nみんなを連れて来ていいって言ってたから。", "zh": "正式演出前一天会进行彩排公演。桃子说可以带大家过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1104_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1105_null", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1106_p", "source_sha256": "cf7a6d59383faa277c00dce6c360e9fa9d563c29d0ff0c15ce6f008eadd4a79d", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様！\nそれじゃ、桃子の舞台のゲネプロを観に……。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n那我们去看桃子舞台剧的彩排……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1107_043nor", "source_sha256": "47e1130d5684774b078b43eeffe153729b1ecdf0ffa6f50860b526e2bee18b33", "ja": "遅いよ、{$P$}！", "zh": "太慢了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1108_046rio", "source_sha256": "2635023244dea63f73e6e830a65c4c845b526a17875231303ccee0b582b5c33e", "ja": "遅いわよ、{$P$}くん！", "zh": "你来晚了，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1109_048rei", "source_sha256": "57e6efa7e6a6da2c0f38e5a4705a452b07cdf45d6a82f9df1f5dd37595ba52e2", "ja": "遅いです、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "来得真晚呀，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1110_001har", "source_sha256": "d5b334fe77d78395cc4bff465c0e2aed3f829d293e771312fe2543cb511e3d87", "ja": "遅いですよ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "您来晚了哦，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1111_p", "source_sha256": "f310c127b1d335ed794d05db0d0bd1b947425e61fca56dde06ba93e6e3e03246", "ja": "す、すまない……って、あれ？\n時間まで、まだだいぶ余裕があるような……？", "zh": "对、对不起……咦？\n好像离约定时间还早得很……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1112_p", "source_sha256": "7bed6c952250ee9dafb8209f7029503432e9c656f2ebbd78e3a3c473a5de9e3e", "ja": "まぁ桃子は早めに入らなくちゃだし、いいか。\n……よし、それじゃ出発だ！", "zh": "不过桃子本来就得早点进场，也无所谓了。\n……好，那我们出发吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1113_null", "source_sha256": "3cd5ed6877e555a64006d654596a04a23ca83ed9fa8a3a8d8ee336ab14f61562", "ja": "ゲネプロ　終了後……", "zh": "彩排结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1114_043nor", "source_sha256": "be6f95bcceb7c702b7c0538dd0b3826ce1b7301595c1c57d36927b1110277875", "ja": "桃子が……うちの桃子が……グスッ。\nていうか、すっごく良かったよね……！？", "zh": "桃子……我们家的桃子……呜呜。\n话说回来，真的特别棒，对吧……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1115_046rio", "source_sha256": "f5914cb833ef510902e1e7171caa661e0931725e2b4953436aac7f91ef6060a7", "ja": "ええ！　とっても素晴らしかったわ！　\n頑張ったのね、桃子ちゃん……グスッ。", "zh": "没错！真的太精彩了！\n桃子真是努力了呢……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1116_001har", "source_sha256": "bb453b3ddffec5c79bce143622e2db56f05fccaa10c2de1eedd0610e92779e10", "ja": "お話も、すごく面白かったね。\n公演が始まったら、話題になりそう……！", "zh": "剧情也非常有意思呢。\n公演开始后，应该会成为话题……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1117_048rei", "source_sha256": "6f39e4689d2bba3e25e42a5799a96ec887a0c5c7b7e25caed13f8f154d3571b9", "ja": "ダブル主演の凛々加ちゃんも、良かったよね？\n桃子ちゃんのお芝居に、食らいついてた気がします！", "zh": "双主演的凛凛加也很棒，对吧？\n感觉她一直在努力跟上桃子的演技！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1118_p", "source_sha256": "398e2755467e9ce51dc79688cc91cdda09b7c85a60154db9d4d40366ec0f15ee", "ja": "ああ、見事だったな。演技初心者なのに\n桃子が相手で、プレッシャーもあっただろうに。", "zh": "啊，确实很出色。明明还是演技新人，\n对手又是桃子，想必也承受了不小的压力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1119_p", "source_sha256": "47c448c00f978208b9dce658a7c5b071ff582bedc5e2d7567d54d0457f647648", "ja": "彼女の演技を、桃子がうまく引き立ててたと思う。\nしかしこれは……予想外というか、脱帽だな……。", "zh": "我觉得桃子很好地衬托出了她的演技。\n不过这还真是……既在意料之外，又让人不得不佩服啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1120_046rio", "source_sha256": "bbe0140f55eab84f7b4df544dd6811acde45c156272271f634230300e07fb3b7", "ja": "桃子ちゃん……！　自分のことを無視した相手なのに、\nそんなふうに気を配って！　本当にすごいわ……！", "zh": "桃子……！明明是无视了自己的人，你却还这样为她着想！真的太了不起了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1121_043nor", "source_sha256": "4a371e9985b6acaa3797be3d7bc00ad65b5dce793ae4020ec183cfe039b7cfe5", "ja": "そうだよ、莉緒姉！\nうちの桃子はすごいんだよ……！　グスッ。", "zh": "没错，莉绪姐！我家桃子可是很厉害的……！抽泣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1122_048rei", "source_sha256": "ffe00ea6b5fdb496aae3cb60c34d205f1a358347a06b79c69a3cad2d6b4001e4", "ja": "泣いちゃダメだよ、のり子ちゃん。せっかくの\n桃子ちゃんの晴れ舞台なんだから、笑って笑って♪", "zh": "别哭啊，法子。难得是桃子大放异彩的舞台，笑一笑，笑一笑♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1123_001har", "source_sha256": "ac476a0ea896aac8d0f2c13cd4032b8b7277e89d61213703d011c1e98dd552e4", "ja": "こんなに、素敵な舞台を見せてもらったんだもん。\n今度は私たちが、全力でサポートしないと、ですね♪", "zh": "能让我们看到这么精彩的舞台。接下来也该轮到我们全力支持了，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_159_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_159_1124_p", "source_sha256": "6449e500a3b27941370b082be099cefe5a34b7b7d0a796e8362d3b2151edf3d9", "ja": "そうだな。みんな、定期公演も\nよろしく頼んだ！", "zh": "没错。大家，定期公演也拜托你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
